title: LZW output larger than the output buffer
description: 65x65. Frame 0 is 64x65 at x=1. Not starting at x=0 means the
description: decoder uses its output buffer, which holds 4096 pixels, and the
description: 4160 pixels overflow it part-way through a code.
description: Expect red, green, blue repeating in the frame's pixel order, with
description: column 0 transparent.
